%% Today, as observed with brok 0.10.0 (brok init --yes).
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Developer
    participant C as brok CLI
    participant W as .brokspace/
    participant N as Network
    U->>C: brok init (VS Code runs brok init --yes)
    C->>W: brok.yml, .gitignore
    C->>W: copy brok-agent found next to brok or on PATH
    alt brok-agent not found
        C-->>U: warning, setup continues without it
    end
    C->>N: download the embedding model (about 140 MB)
    alt download fails
        C-->>U: warning, text search only
    end
    C-->>U: local LLM detection and advice
    C->>W: full index, search is not usable until it ends
    C->>U: writes agent files into the repository (.agents, .vscode/mcp.json)
    C-->>U: "You're set"
